<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="line-chart" data-kv-variant="trend" data-klic-component="line-chart" class="kn-line-chart"><div data-part="metric"><span>주간 방문자</span><strong>8,921</strong><p data-part="muted">지난주 대비 +12.8%</p></div><svg viewBox="0 0 180 56" role="img" aria-label="기간별 추세: 46, 40, 27, 33, 19, 24, 10, 5" data-part="spark"><polyline points="0,46 25,40 50,27 75,33 100,19 125,24 150,10 175,5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/></svg><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span>월</span><span>일</span></div></div>
